# Butler Routes - Shen'dralas (Horde) completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Horde accept in the revisit census (4 quests, docs/shendralas-horde-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin. The blocking pre 93045
# lives in the Desolace (Horde) contract and rides one dedicated when onquest
# mini-step standing alone - never duplicated here. Turn-in-before-accept file
# order throughout the chain (accepts never precede their pres' turnins).
# No race, class or profession gates: nothing contracted is locked. The Outcast
# Hideaway event rides its data-placed point; the Desolace expedition leg
# switches frames deliberately and switches back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/shendralas-horde
title Shen'dralas (Horde)
levels 30-35
zone Shen'dralas
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Kalimdor
coords live
version 1

step Nerlokh's word (soft pre)

  zone map 2652

  when onquest 93045

  tip Holding 93045 (Test Your Theory, from Uthek the Wise in the Desolace (Horde) guide): Nerlokh (20.93, 22.68) offers the rescue pair on 2652.
  accept 93058 -- Saving Our Own - Nerlokh; talk it through
  turnin 93058 -- Saving Our Own - the word to Nerlokh
  accept 93062 -- Bone Burying - Nerlokh; talk it through
  turnin 93062 -- Bone Burying - the word to Nerlokh

step Outcast Hideaway - checking things out

  zone map 2652

  accept 93122 -- Checking Things Out - Nerlokh; investigate the Outcast Hideaway
  complete 93122 @34.85,74.78 -- Investigate the Outcast Hideaway, east
  turnin 93122 -- Checking Things Out - the word to Nerlokh
  accept 93128 -- Khan Jehn - Nerlokh; Uthek takes it in Desolace

step Desolace expedition - Uthek's word

  zone Desolace

  turnin 93128 -- Khan Jehn - the word to Uthek the Wise @36.22,79.25
  zone Shen'dralas
